      <div class="recipe-invitation"><Coffee :size="19"/><p>Pilih contoh yang bikin penasaran. Amati susunannya, ubah satu bagian, lalu lihat hasilnya. Nggak perlu menunggu hafal semua materi.</p><span>{{recipes.length}} contoh gabungan</span></div>
      <div class="recipe-grid"><button v-for="item in recipes" :key="item.id" class="recipe-card" @click="emit('select',item.id)">
        <div class="recipe-card-top"><span class="recipe-icon"><component :is="icons[item.icon] ?? Layers" :size="26"/></span><span><Clock :size="12"/>{{item.minutes}} menit eksplorasi</span></div>
        <h3>{{item.title}}</h3><p>{{item.description}}</p><div class="recipe-ingredients"><span v-for="tag in combinations[item.id]" :key="tag">{{tag}}</span></div><span class="recipe-card-action">Bongkar contoh ini<ArrowRight :size="16"/></span>
      </button></div>
